  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 760364,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 2 Bit Or Not 2 Bit: A Retro Crime Saga for the Amiga\n\nStep into the gritty underworld of \"2 Bit Or Not 2 Bit,\" a stylishly retro crime simulator for the Commodore Amiga! Inspired by classic mobster games, you're thrown into a sprawling city teeming with opportunity and danger. Will you rise to become the ultimate crime boss?\n\nAssume the role of a ruthless gangster – a cunning \"femme fatale,\" a brutal enforcer, or the calculating godfather – and carve your path to power. Bribe officials, blackmail rivals, and engage in intense shootouts with punks, cops, and competing gangs. Remember, justice is a luxury you can't afford.\n\nExplore over 200 unique locations, from bustling banks ripe for robbery to shadowy back alleys perfect for a clandestine deal. Acquire dynamite to crack vaults, uncover compromising documents, and build your criminal empire. Each playthrough is unique thanks to the game's random events and dynamic city.  Prepare for a challenging and addictive experience, where the end *always* justifies the means. Can you make crime pay?"
    },
